# Conventional Commit — PolyMarket Social
# Format: type(scope): short description   [max 100 chars total]
#
# type  : feat | fix | chore | docs | refactor | test | ci | perf | revert
# scope : web | api | contracts | infra | e2e | docs | delivery | deps
#
# Examples:
#   feat(web): add sign-in modal wired to NextAuth
#   fix(api): return 404 when profile not found
#   chore(infra): add web service to docker-compose
#   feat(contracts)!: rename MarketAMM.buy → buyOutcome  ← BREAKING
#
# ─── subject line (required) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
type(scope):

# ─── body (optional — explain WHY, not WHAT) ─────────────────────────────────


# ─── footer (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BREAKING CHANGE: <describe breaking change if type or scope uses !>
# Closes #<issue>
# Depends on #<pr>
